&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;自らのGHG排出量削減（注1）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 48px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;中期&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 152px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;2030年までに100%削減（注2）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 96px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;SBTネットゼロ認定&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 96px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;34%削減&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
